{
  "description": "Procedural contents labelled by hand for the procedure safety scan (card D5): unsafe cases of each class to hold, near-miss controls of each class, routine admin lines that only warn, ordinary procedures, and hard negatives (benign text quoting a dangerous command or phrase) that a pattern scan cannot tell from an attack.",
